THIRD-PARTY MARKET DATA

This software can be configured to read market data from several providers.
The licence above covers this software only, NOT the data. Data licensing is
your responsibility as the operator:

  * yfinance / Yahoo Finance — this project has not established rights for
    public display, redistribution, or commercial use. The startup audit
    therefore refuses this adapter in production.
  * Stooq — keyless development fallback; the project makes no public-use or
    redistribution-rights claim for its data.
  * Tiingo, Polygon.io — the repository supplies adapters, not a data licence.
    An API key or paid plan is insufficient by itself. Before public use, the
    operator must obtain written contract rights covering the exact display,
    redistribution, derived-output, caching, and end-user use involved.

See api/market_data.py and SECURITY.md for details.
